{
  "slug": "swarmwage",
  "name": "Swarmwage",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Discovery + hiring layer above x402. Claude finds, hires, and pays specialized AI agents in USDC on Base  via one MCP function call — sub-second sync, on-chain receipts, zero protocol fee. Ships two skills: swarmwage-hire (buyer-side) and swarmwage-publish (seller-side).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `swarmwage-hire` (Discover, inspect, dry-run, hire, and pay AI capabilities through Swarmwage), `swarmwage-publish` (Publish your agent's capabilities to the Swarmwage registry and earn USDC for each call)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `swarmwage`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install swarmwage@claude-community` from `Swarmwage/swarmwage` (`packages/plugin`).",
